            "label": "Featured card — paragraph",
            "group": "The Work",
            "value": "Our relationships matter. This is the framework at the heart of my work. At its core is a simple but important idea: our relationships matter. The ways we've experienced connection, safety, and belonging shape how we understand ourselves and how we show up with others. And this doesn't stop with our early relationships — our partnerships, friendships, and even work relationships continue to influence us.",
