        {
            "name": "faqIntro",
            "label": "Intro text (beside the questions)",
            "group": "FAQ",
            "value": "Starting therapy brings up a lot of questions — that's more than okay. Here are the ones I hear most often.",
            "type": "textarea"
        },
        {
            "name": "sessionCostFee",
            "label": "Fee line (shown large & bold)",
            "group": "FAQ",
            "value": "My standard fee is $175 for a 50-minute session.",
            "type": "text"
        },
        {
            "name": "sessionCostP1",
            "label": "Session cost paragraph 1",
            "group": "FAQ",
            "value": "At this time, I have chosen to operate as a private-pay practice and do not bill insurance directly. This wasn't a decision I made lightly. I recognize that insurance coverage can make therapy more accessible and affordable for many people. At the same time, choosing not to work directly with insurance allows for greater flexibility and autonomy in how I practice and how we approach our work together.",
            "type": "textarea"
        },
        {
            "name": "sessionCostP2",
            "label": "Session cost paragraph 2",
            "group": "FAQ",
            "value": "I believe therapy should be accessible to everyone, not just those who can comfortably afford it. With that in mind, I reserve a limited number of spaces in my practice for clients seeking a reduced fee through a sliding scale.",
            "type": "textarea"
        },
        {
            "name": "sessionCostP3",
            "label": "Session cost paragraph 3",
            "group": "FAQ",
            "value": "If you're interested in a sliding-scale space, or if the cost of therapy feels like a barrier, please reach out. Even if I don't have a reduced-fee opening available, I'm happy to talk through other options or help you explore ways to access support.",
            "type": "textarea"
        },
        {
            "name": "faqAsideBtnLabel",
            "label": "Button label (beside the questions)",
            "group": "FAQ",
            "value": "Ask your own",
            "type": "text"
        },
        {
            "name": "faqItems",
            "label": "Questions & answers",
            "group": "FAQ",
            "type": "repeater",
            "value": [
                {
                    "question": "How does online therapy work?",
                    "answer": "All sessions are held online via a secure, HIPAA-compliant video platform — from wherever you feel most comfortable, anywhere in Minnesota."
                },
                {
                    "question": "How do I know if we're a good fit?",
                    "answer": "That's exactly what the free 15–20 minute consultation is for. It's a low-pressure conversation to see if my style and approach feel right for you. If not, I'm glad to offer referrals."
                },
                {
                    "question": "Is everything confidential?",
                    "answer": "Yes. Your privacy is protected by law and by my own ethical commitment. The only exceptions are standard legal duties around imminent harm, which we'll discuss in our first session."
                }
            ],
